  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Power Up&quot; - a girls education initiative that aims to improve enrolment, retention and transition for marginalized girls in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2025, Power Up will improve the enrollment, retention, attainment and transition out of school into highereducation or work for 15,300 adolescent girls in Sierra Leone. This will be achieved by creating an enablingenvironment in 17 communities for better girl&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122;s education and the realisation of their rights, while ensuring girls havethe skills and support to overcome barriers, excel in school, and become leaders to improve education in theircommunities.</narrative>
  </description>
